flowchart TD
    A[Need business number e.g. PAT/INV/LAB-ORD/ADM] --> B[Call nextXxxSequence(db, orgId)]
    B --> C[INSERT INTO counters (id, orgId, key, value, updatedAt) VALUES (...,1,NOW())]
    C --> D{ON CONFLICT (orgId,key)?}
    D -- No --> E[RETURNING value = 1]
    D -- Yes --> F[DO UPDATE SET value = counters.value+1 RETURNING value]
    E --> G[formatXxxNumber(seq, year=UTC now)]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Return formatted string e.g. PAT-2026-000001]
    Note1[Serialized by unique index; runs in tx with RLS scope]
    Note2[Seq never resets; year from UTC]
    Note3[No DB serials; UUIDv7 PKs never exposed]
    C --> Note1
    G --> Note2
    A --> Note3
